{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h3yBefrkUN1795445201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐元區服務業活動的擴張步伐稍為減慢，製造業活動則加快擴張。</p><p></p><p>標準普爾全球公布歐元區服務業採購經理指數，11月報51.2，低過市場預期和10月數值。11月製造業採購經理指數，則升至52.9，較市場預期和10月高0.2。綜合採購經理指數11月維持於51.7，市場原本預期升至52。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.507488+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:19.545248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:13.378040+00:00","content_hash":"401c37016bf240e2800faedea28a91bac1993e4e60456a079240c4f13265f957","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}